OL,3,GNEWSA'Workarounds' needed for full
OL,4,AMartha's Rule use
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new NHS scheme allowing patients and
OL,7,Ffamilies to ask for an urgent second
OL,8,Fopinion if a patient's condition
OL,9,Fdeteriorates will be rolled out at
OL,10,FGuernsey's emergency department, health
OL,11,Fleaders say.
OL,13,FMartha's Rule is due to be in place at
OL,14,Fall NHS England hospitals by March 2028
OL,15,Ffollowing the death of Martha Mills,
OL,16,Fwho died from sepsis after family
OL,17,Fconcerns were not listened to.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
