OL,3,GNEWSA'Workarounds' needed for full
OL,4,AMartha's Rule use
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth and Social Care President George
OL,7,FOswald said Guernsey would follow the
OL,8,Fguidance and timeframes, but it will be
OL,9,F"more difficult" for maternity
OL,10,Fservices.
OL,12,FHe said: "In terms of the breadth of
OL,13,Fexperience and what staff we have
OL,14,Favailable to provide the appropriate
OL,15,Fservice in those particular areas... is
OL,16,Fmore difficult."
